flowchart TD
    Start[Speak Request] --> Debounce{Check Debounce}

    Debounce -->|Duplicate within 100ms| Ignore[Ignore Request]
    Debounce -->|New or outside window| Check[Check Text]

    Check --> Nav{Navigation Command?}
    Nav -->|Up/Down/Left/Right/Tab| Ignore
    Nav -->|Other text| Detect{Detect Language}

    Detect -->|Contains Bengali<br/>U+0980-U+09FF| Bengali[Route to Bengali API]
    Detect -->|Latin script| Lexicon{Romanized Bengali<br/>lexicon match?}

    Lexicon -->|Known form| Canonical[Convert to canonical<br/>Bengali script]
    Canonical --> Bengali
    Lexicon -->|No match or ambiguous| Local[Route to English engine]

    Bengali --> API[Bengali TextToSpeechApi]
    API --> PlayAPI[Play Audio from API]
    PlayAPI --> Done[Complete]

    Local --> SSML{Apply SSML?}
    SSML -->|Tone/Pitch set| BuildSSML[Build SSML with prosody]
    SSML -->|Default| Direct[Direct text]

    BuildSSML & Direct --> Synth[SpeechSynthesizer]
    Synth --> PlayLocal[Speak via System.Speech]
    PlayLocal --> Done

    Ignore --> Done
